    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Friends is a cozy multiplayer sandbox where players explore a vibrant world, catch fish, play instruments, and uncover secrets with friends or on their own. Complete a rich compendium filled with animals, vehicles, fish, and locations to discover. From riding cows to paddling along beaches, playing music around a campfire, chilling in a nightclub or a yacht, it's a blend of chill vibes and discovery. The real treasures are the Fireside Friends made along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-BE YOURSELF-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/4c3d6382e4ab1b35a0f26aced9c012be.poster.avif?t=1753885397\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/4c3d6382e4ab1b35a0f26aced9c012be.webm?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/4c3d6382e4ab1b35a0f26aced9c012be.mp4?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the character customizer to dress your avatar just the way you like it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-RIDE LIKE THE WIND-</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/8ef2736082c30a00d02b772a3b4ca8b1.poster.avif?t=1753885397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/8ef2736082c30a00d02b772a3b4ca8b1.webm?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/8ef2736082c30a00d02b772a3b4ca8b1.mp4?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in rideable animals, cars, bikes, or take a hike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-SAIL AWAY-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/79a0c52aaeca41d837a14599e632ddb8.poster.avif?t=1753885397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/79a0c52aaeca41d837a14599e632ddb8.webm?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/79a0c52aaeca41d837a14599e632ddb8.mp4?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy water sports like Paddleboarding, or go on a rowboat trip while fishing or playing some music.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fireside Friends is a cozy multiplayer sandbox where players explore a vibrant world, catch fish, play instruments, and uncover secrets with friends or on their own. Complete a rich compendium filled with animals, vehicles, fish, and locations to discover. From riding cows to paddling along beaches, playing music around a campfire, chilling in a nightclub or a yacht, it's a blend of chill vibes and discovery. The real treasures are the Fireside Friends made along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-BE YOURSELF-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/4c3d6382e4ab1b35a0f26aced9c012be.poster.avif?t=1753885397\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/4c3d6382e4ab1b35a0f26aced9c012be.webm?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/4c3d6382e4ab1b35a0f26aced9c012be.mp4?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the character customizer to dress your avatar just the way you like it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-RIDE LIKE THE WIND-</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/8ef2736082c30a00d02b772a3b4ca8b1.poster.avif?t=1753885397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/8ef2736082c30a00d02b772a3b4ca8b1.webm?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/8ef2736082c30a00d02b772a3b4ca8b1.mp4?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the world in rideable animals, cars, bikes, or take a hike.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-SAIL AWAY-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/79a0c52aaeca41d837a14599e632ddb8.poster.avif?t=1753885397\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/79a0c52aaeca41d837a14599e632ddb8.webm?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3681060/extras/79a0c52aaeca41d837a14599e632ddb8.mp4?t=1753885397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy water sports like Paddleboarding, or go on a rowboat trip while fishing or playing some music.</p>",
    "short_description": "Fireside Friends is a cozy multiplayer sandbox where players explore a vast world, catch fish, play instruments, and uncover secrets with friends or on their own. Complete a rich compendium filled with animals, vehicles, fish, and locations to discover. It's a kid's game for adults!",
